rhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5903100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606369301" alt="Pedagon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5903100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" >Pedagon</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/themanhattenproject" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3809943&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606369301" alt="TheManhattenProject" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3809943)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/themanhattenproject" >TheManhattenProject</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/oystershell" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2796394&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606369301" alt="Oystershell" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2796394)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/oystershell" >Oystershell</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/apoplexic" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2767424&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606369301" alt="Apoplexic" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2767424)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/apoplexic" >Apoplexic</a></span></p> <p><strong>EDIT:</strong> I'm aware that the graph image in Addendum 3 is hard to see. I have attempted several fixes; however, the problem seems to stem from the Y2K theme and its pixelated aesthetic.</p> 
